[stderr] +
[stderr] +## Objective
[stderr] +
[stderr] +Define the semantic, responsive web/PWA game-shell contract around the shared
[stderr] +session and game state. It specifies labelled navigation, panel/focus routing,
[stderr] +viewport profiles, reflow, and non-colour cues without creating a PWA-specific
[stderr] +UI, final presentation assets, or fixed device-support claim.
