[stderr] +
[stderr] +R0010 supplies the shared accessibility foundation and R0021 supplies session
[stderr] +and checkpoint presentation state. This shell consumes their public states and
[stderr] +routes panels to them without changing their APIs. GATE-0002 remains an
[stderr] +implementation gate for numeric/browser-device thresholds and GATE-0004
[stderr] +remains a gate for final content and layout choices.
